{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first 3 days of the seclusion system and get a taste of what\u2019s to come in this exciting demo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avery Stardust, an enigmatic automaton, is trapped in the mysterious Global Psychometric Assessment Program with a chilling sentence: death in 17 days unless He can recall his reset code. A 6-letter code is all that stands between life and death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Days in Prison</strong>: Experience the mysteries of the SYNCO PATH program as a highly advanced machine with an overactive imagination. Traverse a maze of surreal nightmares in a quest to uncover the truth hidden within your own memories. What could be more terrifying than being alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reject Determined Destiny: </strong>From your prison cell, dive into a world gripped by the algorithmic control of the globe-spanning Stagnation Protocol. What does it mean to secure a future, and what must one do to determine their own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove yourself of sound mind: </strong>Dream, draw, and use your wits and tools to unravel the complex mystery that lies at the root of your occupancy. In this austere prison, only one code matters.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is far more than what the mind perceives.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And no one is ever truly alone...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993750?t=1757711063","background_raw":"https